WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.887 --> 00:00:18.053
and Mandy walked down the streets of Florence with Leo.

2
00:00:19.174 --> 00:00:23.996
As they walked, Mandy thought there must be something special about the boy.

3
00:00:25.177 --> 00:00:26.898
Everyone seemed to like him.

4
00:00:28.079 --> 00:00:32.088
Vinnie said, "Mandy, look up!"

5
00:00:32.128 --> 00:00:33.308
Mandy lifted her head.

6
00:00:34.369 --> 00:00:38.330
People were looking down at them from open windows and balconies.

7
00:00:38.350 --> 00:00:41.391
"Why is everyone staring at us?"

8
00:00:41.991 --> 00:00:42.691
Vinnie asked.

9
00:00:44.251 --> 00:00:45.072
Leo laughed.

10
00:00:45.092 --> 00:00:48.313
"They're not staring at you.

11
00:00:49.253 --> 00:00:52.174
They're just enjoying the view from their balconies."

12
00:00:52.194 --> 00:00:55.394
"Enjoying the view of the street?"

13
00:00:55.995 --> 00:00:56.735
asked Mandy.

14
00:00:56.755 --> 00:01:00.156
"Yes! Watching people is fun!

15
00:01:00.416 --> 00:01:03.485
Look!" Leo opened his notebook.

16
00:01:04.985 --> 00:01:09.748
The pages were filled with extraordinary pictures of people and animals.

17
00:01:09.768 --> 00:01:13.949
"Leo! You're amazing!"

18
00:01:14.550 --> 00:01:15.510
Mandy gasped.

19
00:01:16.651 --> 00:01:18.992
"No wonder your teacher says you're gifted!"

20
00:01:19.412 --> 00:01:20.452
exclaimed Vinnie.

21
00:01:21.633 --> 00:01:24.134
Leo shrugged and closed his notebook.

22
00:01:24.154 --> 00:01:28.776
"Tell us about the Medici family," asked Mandy.

23
00:01:29.676 --> 00:01:33.818
"They are the most powerful family in Florence," said Leo.

24
00:01:34.898 --> 00:01:36.279
"What do they want you to do?"

25
00:01:36.759 --> 00:01:37.439
asked Vinnie.

26
00:01:37.459 --> 00:01:40.681
"All artists need supporters.

27
00:01:41.741 --> 00:01:45.403
Powerful families such as the Medici hire artists.

28
00:01:46.523 --> 00:01:50.645
Master Verrocchio's workshop does a lot of work for them," said Leo.

29
00:01:50.665 --> 00:01:54.486
"We make furniture and portraits of their family.

30
00:01:55.587 --> 00:01:57.908
We even make their kitchen utensils."

31
00:01:59.460 --> 00:02:01.841
Leo stopped in front of a large estate.

32
00:02:02.882 --> 00:02:03.702
"Here we are!"

33
00:02:04.083 --> 00:02:04.623
he said.

34
00:02:05.663 --> 00:02:10.466
Leo led them through a gate and into a courtyard with a lovely garden.

35
00:02:10.486 --> 00:02:16.149
"My lord Lorenzo is expecting you, sir," said a servant by the door.

36
00:02:17.190 --> 00:02:20.952
He took them inside the palace and into a large courtyard.

37
00:02:20.972 --> 00:02:25.434
"Whoa!" Vinnie said loudly.

38
00:02:25.454 --> 00:02:28.516
"It looks like a museum!"

39
00:02:29.724 --> 00:02:32.386
The stone walls were decorated with carvings.

40
00:02:32.406 --> 00:02:37.370
"The family must really love art," remarked Mandy.

41
00:02:37.390 --> 00:02:42.935
"Leo!" called a young man about seventeen years old.

42
00:02:44.056 --> 00:02:46.058
He came toward them and smiled.

43
00:02:47.138 --> 00:02:50.962
He wore a shirt with puffy sleeves and a high lace collar.

44
00:02:52.303 --> 00:02:53.724
"Welcome," he said.

45
00:02:53.744 --> 00:02:55.886
"Please have a seat."

46
00:02:55.906 --> 00:03:02.322
"These are my friends," Leo said, introducing Vinnie and Mandy.

47
00:03:03.483 --> 00:03:05.224
A servant brought in some cakes.

48
00:03:05.244 --> 00:03:09.927
"I am a great admirer of you, Leo," said Lorenzo.

49
00:03:09.947 --> 00:03:12.569
"You and I have a lot in common."

50
00:03:12.589 --> 00:03:14.931
"In what way, my lord?"

51
00:03:15.451 --> 00:03:16.192
asked Leo.

52
00:03:16.212 --> 00:03:20.054
"We're both young," began Lorenzo.

53
00:03:20.074 --> 00:03:22.236
"We're both intelligent.

54
00:03:23.216 --> 00:03:24.777
And we both love art."

55
00:03:25.918 --> 00:03:28.420
Leo nodded, but remained quiet.

56
00:03:29.896 --> 00:03:36.479
"One day, I will make Florence the most beautiful city in the world," Lorenzo said confidently.

57
00:03:36.499 --> 00:03:40.460
"And I believe you and I can do that together."

58
00:03:40.480 --> 00:03:45.142
"Florence is already magnificent," replied Leo.

59
00:03:45.162 --> 00:03:47.163
"I agree.

60
00:03:47.583 --> 00:03:49.904
But I intend to make it more so."

61
00:03:51.245 --> 00:03:52.245
Lorenzo laughed.

62
00:03:52.265 --> 00:03:59.488
"Then people will say, 'He is Lorenzo, the one who made Florence magnificent!'"

63
00:04:00.932 --> 00:04:02.555
Mandy choked on her cake.

64
00:04:03.556 --> 00:04:06.220
Finally she realized who this man was.

65
00:04:06.240 --> 00:04:10.385
"He's Lorenzo the Magnificent!"

66
00:04:11.126 --> 00:04:12.568
she wanted to scream.

67
00:04:13.890 --> 00:04:17.756
She was eating cake with the future ruler of Florence, Italy!
